---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Now" description="What I'm currently focused on.">
	<section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
		<h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">Now</h1>
		<p class="text-stone mb-12 text-sm">Updated June 2026</p>

		<div class="space-y-8 text-ink-light leading-relaxed">
			<div>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">Building</h2>
				<p>
					Working on AI-powered developer tools and exploring how to make
					language models more reliable in production environments.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">Thinking about</h2>
				<p class="mb-4">
					Most AI products today are <a href="https://koomen.dev/essays/horseless-carriages/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">horseless carriages</a>.
					Old interfaces with AI tacked on, not reimagined around it.
					I write code to think, and lately three questions drive my work:
				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 marker:text-accent">
					<li><strong class="text-ink">Where AI lives</strong> is in the interface itself: not a feature you open, but something you feel.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-ink">What makes AI useful</strong> is doing the right thing quietly, not making suggestions you constantly have to fix.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-ink">What makes AI trustworthy</strong> is being transparent, predictable, and honest about what it can and can't do.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">Reading</h2>
				<p>
					Currently worming my way through Terry Pratchett's <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Discworld" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discworld</a> 🪱 — forty-odd novels of footnotes and quiet wisdom, and I'm in no hurry to reach the last one.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-stone-light/30">
			<p class="text-sm text-stone">
				A <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline underline-offset-2">now page</a>: what I'm focused on at this point in my life.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
